          "w": 12,
          "x": 0.65,
          "y": 1.25,
          "content": "The harbor levy failed twice: once at the ballot box and once more in committee, and the two failures have different causes that are usually conflated in press coverage. Understanding each separately is the only way to draft a third attempt that survives contact with the harbor board, the fishing cooperatives, and the state auditors.",
