          "color": "#364A50"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "role": "body",
          "content": "The levy needed dockworkers and merchants to campaign together. They never shared a room: the merchants met downtown on Tuesdays while the dockworkers met at the hall on Thursdays, and neither group trusted the consultants who carried messages between them. Turnout collapsed in exactly the precincts the levy needed most.",
          "x": 1,
          "y": 2.95,
          "w": 5.5,
          "h": 1.35,
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": 400,
          "tracking": 0,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "align": "left",
          "color": "#364A50"
        },
        {
          "id": "star2",
          "role": "body",
          "content": "★",
          "x": 0.65,
          "y": 4.35,
          "w": 0.3,
          "h": 0.3,
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": 700,
          "tracking": 0,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "align": "left",
          "color": "#FDC933"
        },
        {
          "id": "sub2",
          "role": "body",
          "content": "Numbers that moved",
          "x": 1,
          "y": 4.33,
          "w": 5.5,
          "h": 0.32,
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": 700,
          "tracking": 0,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "align": "left",
          "color": "#364A50"
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "role": "body",
          "content": "Revenue projections changed three times during the campaign as fuel prices swung. Each revision gave opponents a fresh headline, and the final estimate landed the week before the vote, too late to explain. Voters remembered the revisions, not the reasons.",
          "x": 1,
          "y": 4.68,
          "w": 5.5,
          "h": 1.6,
          "fontSize": 13,
