        },
        {
          "id": "sub3",
          "role": "body",
          "content": "The audit nobody read",
          "x": 7.2,
          "y": 2.6,
          "w": 5.5,
          "h": 0.32,
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": 700,
          "tracking": 0,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "align": "left",
          "color": "#364A50"
        },
        {
          "id": "body3",
          "role": "body",
          "content": "A favorable state audit arrived in August and sat unread while the committee debated procedure. By the time anyone quoted it, the narrative had hardened. Timing beat substance.",
          "x": 7.2,
          "y": 2.95,
          "w": 5.5,
